[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":110},["ShallowReactive",2],{"news-detail-cambridge-africa-changemakers-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-opportunity-180":3},{"news":4,"more":27},{"id":5,"slug":6,"title":7,"content":8,"authorName":9,"authorId":10,"status":11,"recommended":12,"datePosted":13,"deadline":14,"images":15,"notifiedAt":14,"notifiedBy":14,"createdAt":13,"updatedAt":21,"categories":22,"readTime":24},180,"cambridge-africa-changemakers-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-opportunity-180","Cambridge Africa Changemakers Scholarship 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity","\u003Cp>This scholarship program offers full-cost funding for studies across all disciplines. Candidates from any African country are eligible to apply.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Cambridge University Changemakers Scholarship Abstract\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Scholarship Host: Cambridge Trust\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Category: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002F\">Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002F\">Study Abroad\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarship\u002Fscholarships-in-uk\u002F\">Study-In-UK\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fpostgraduate-scholarships\u002F\">Postgraduate Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fmasters-scholarships\u002F\">Masters Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa> || \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fscholarsworld.ng\u002Fscholarships\u002Fphd-scholarships\u002F\">PhD Scholarships\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Benefits: Full Scholarship\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Tuition\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Accommodation\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Living Stipends\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Visa\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Medical Insurance\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Eligibility: African Countries\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Deadline: Varies by Course\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Cambridge Africa Changemakers Scholarship Details\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Applications for the 2026 Cambridge Africa Changemakers Scholarship have begun for qualified and interested African students.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The scholarship is valid in any college affiliated with the University of Cambridge and is in close association with the\u003Cstrong> \u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The Cambridge Africa Changemakers Scholarship is a programme of full-cost scholarships for PhD students in any subject, open to candidates from any country in Africa. It is tenable at any college.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>It aims to provide support to talented students who require financial assistance to take up their places at the University, whose research research contributes to the development of the Continent and to climate-resilient and sustainable futures for Africa and the world. \u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>2026 Cambridge University Changemakers Scholarship Requirements\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To be eligible for the Cambridge Africa Changemakers Scholarship, applicants must satisfy the following conditions:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be of African origin\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Be pursuing a doctoral degree in a recognized institution located in Africa\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Cambridge Africa Changemakers Scholarship Benefits and Timeline\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The scholarship is similar to Mastercard Foundation Scholars Program\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Beneficiaries of the Cambridge Africa Changemakers Scholarship will receive:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Full coverage of the University tuition fee.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A yearly stipend adequate for a single individual.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Coverage of the Immigration Health Surcharge.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Visa fees.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Allowances for travel and research-related expenses.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>Cambridge Africa Changemakers Scholarship Benefits and Timeline\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>The scholarship is similar to Mastercard Foundation Scholars Program\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>Beneficiaries of the Cambridge Africa Changemakers Scholarship will receive:\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Full coverage of the University tuition fee.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>A yearly stipend adequate for a single individual.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Coverage of the Immigration Health Surcharge.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Visa fees.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Allowances for travel and research-related expenses.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>\u003Cstrong>How To Apply for 2026 Cambridge Africa Changemakers Scholarship\u003C\u002Fstrong>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>To apply for the Cambridge Africa Changemakers Scholarship program, interested and qualified candidates should apply for a doctoral program at the University of Cambridge.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Interested candidates do not need to submit a separate scholarship application.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>The scholarship consideration is part of the University of Cambridge admission process.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>Applicants must submit their university admission application by the funding deadline specific to their chosen course.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003Cli>\u003Cp>This information can be found in the University’s Postgraduate Course Directory.\u003Cbr \u002F>For More Information\u003C\u002Fp>\u003C\u002Fli>\u003C\u002Ful>\u003Cp>APPLY HERE: \u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.cambridgetrust.org\u002F\">https:\u002F\u002Fwww.cambridgetrust.org\u002F\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>\u003C\u002Fp>","Linkskool",16,"published",0,"2026-04-24 12:27:20",null,[16],{"fileName":17,"oldFileName":17,"type":18,"file":19,"url":20},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fcambridge-africa-changemakers-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F69eb53984cad58.38138329_screenshot 2026-04-24 121837.png","image","","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fcambridge-africa-changemakers-scholarship-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F69eb53984cad58.38138329_screenshot%202026-04-24%20121837.png","2026-06-24 11:55:43",[23],{"id":24,"name":25,"createdAt":26},2,"Opportunities","2026-01-07 13:35:07",[28,38,48,57,66,75,84,93,101],{"id":29,"slug":30,"title":31,"images":32,"datePosted":36,"authorName":37},305,"dartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Dartmouth College Kings Scholarship Usa 2026: Fully Funded Opportunity",[33],{"fileName":34,"oldFileName":34,"type":18,"file":19,"url":35},"assets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot 2026-06-24 204255.png","https:\u002F\u002Flinkskool.com\u002Fassets\u002Felearning\u002Flrm\u002Fexplore\u002Fnews\u002Fdartmouth-college-kings-scholarship-usa-2026-fully-funded-opportunity\u002F6a3c3537be16a2.95289717_screenshot%202026-06-24%20204255.png","2026-06-24 20:51:19","LINKSKOOL",{"id":39,"slug":40,"title":41,"images":42,"datePosted":46,"authorName":47},304,"mexican-government-scholarship-for-foreigners-2026-fully-funded-opportunity","Mexican Government Schola